<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>second day of the first test between the West Indies and India</p>
<p>at Sabina Park on Friday:</p>
<p>West Indies first innings (overnight 300-4)</p>
<p> S.Campbell c Mongia b Joshi	   40</p>
<p> S.Williams b Kuruvilla		  23</p>
